Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.88,0:00:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.75,0:00:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,have you heard the story behind Ruijerd{*}-san{*}'s spear?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.76,0:00:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. A real tearjerker, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.14,0:00:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.89,0:00:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish we could do something for him.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.77,0:00:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I recently started work on my old plan.{As with past narrations, I'm forcing a present tense perspective (though that doesn't mean that lines like this should also be in present tense)}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.52,0:00:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The idea is to write a book on the Sperd and spread the plain truth about their past.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.15,0:00:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I'm not sure how to present it.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.66,0:00:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A documentary approach? Diary style?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.16,0:00:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe I shouldn't go for an epic to start.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.66,0:01:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How about a cheap pamphlet, \Nsay ten pages, packaged with a figure?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.25,0:01:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you working on?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.55,0:01:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I happen to be writing a book of Ruijerd{*}-san{*}'s heroic exploits.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.26,0:01:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.80,0:01:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you have?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.89,0:01:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm just getting started.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.52,0:01:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Would you let me help?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:23.90,0:01:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.81,0:01:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruijerd{*}-san{*} told me a lot about his past,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.61,0:01:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,so I think I could write some stories, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.82,0:01:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.95,0:01:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't forget about school, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:37.20,0:01:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.35,0:03:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Aisha.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.64,0:03:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have something to say, don't hold back.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.93,0:03:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.48,0:03:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, if you think I'm spending too much time with Norn and want more attention.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.40,0:03:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Or if you're struggling with work and want time off.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.73,0:03:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.53,0:03:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one thing, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.28,0:03:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Please pay me!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.70,0:03:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come again!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.33,0:03:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want those for?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.87,0:03:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I collected flower seeds on our trip, \Nso now I'd like to grow them.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.17,0:03:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that strange?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.76,0:03:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.17,0:03:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, maybe we should get some soil, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.64,0:04:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The earth around here is pretty barren.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.01,0:04:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping you would make me some with your magic.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.23,0:04:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you mind?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.81,0:04:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.10,0:04:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.70,0:04:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you buying those for Sylphie{*}-nee{*}?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.78,0:04:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I try to treat my wife right.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.20,0:04:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sylphie{*}-nee{*}'s a lucky woman.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.00,0:04:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Onii-sama{*Big Brother}, spare some of that love for me when you have time.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.88,0:04:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. Dad would punch my lights out.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.84,0:04:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.09,0:04:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't give you a better deal than this.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.51,0:04:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little lower, please.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.60,0:04:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My big brother is {\i1}the{\i0} Rudeus Greyrat, the famous mage.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.68,0:04:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.60,0:04:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Even {*}Ariel-sama, princess{*Princess Ariel} of the Asura Kingdom{*},{*} respects him.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.94,0:04:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Greyrat... {*}Ariel-sama{*Princess Ariel}... I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.40,0:05:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you have a deal.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.16,0:05:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.62,0:05:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I could chip in a little if you're short.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.54,0:05:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't worry. I have just enough!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.50,0:05:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.50,0:05:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know if she's got business sense or what, but it's scaring me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.96,0:05:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been wanting something cute like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.01,0:05:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't Lilia{*}-san{*} buy one for you?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.34,0:05:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother told me no.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.60,0:05:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She said a maid shouldn't buy furnishings to her own tastes.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.52,0:05:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't I keep it?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.44,0:05:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you can.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.62,0:05:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll summon something organic from our old world.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.20,0:05:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Organic?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.50,0:05:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Hopefully food.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.33,0:05:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Um, do you really need the step with the conditions?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.88,0:06:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Wouldn't it suck if I landed in a foreign country when I went back?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.14,0:06:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.43,0:06:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, she'll summon things closer and closer to human,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.77,0:06:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}then finish with a return trip straight to Japan.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.60,0:06:18.90,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,I'll have to make use of my contact again\N to study conditional summoning.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.90,0:06:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The "authority on summoning magic"?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.86,0:06:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.86,0:06:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, not to change the subject, \Nbut here's the reward I mentioned.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.74,0:06:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.87,0:06:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A summoning circle for lamplight spirits.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.79,0:06:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,They follow the caster while emitting bright light.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.33,0:06:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, they do fade over time.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.34,0:06:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even the Mages' Guild knows this circle.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.47,0:06:45.55,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,The person I mentioned invented it.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.55,0:06:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.18,0:06:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What Japanese guy doesn't go nuts for limited editions?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.60,0:06:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you something even better if the next experiment succeeds.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.52,0:06:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So, please, keep helping me out!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.15,0:07:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Zanoba finally finished making a figure his own way.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.91,0:07:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I guess he gave it to Julie.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.45,0:07:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Master! Grand Master! Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.83,0:07:19.29,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,Keep working hard.{not sure what to do with that acknowledgement before this line.}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.29,0:07:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.42,0:07:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Man. Zanoba giving away a figure.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.01,0:07:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that nice, Julie?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.68,0:07:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Take good care of it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.09,0:07:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After helping Ruijerd bring my sisters here,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.72,0:07:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Here you are.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.76,0:07:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.89,0:07:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ginger went back to work for Zanoba.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.27,0:07:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's even teaching Julie etiquette.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.27,0:07:38.27,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.06,0:07:42.23,Default,hon?,0,0,0,,{\an8}Thank you, too, Dame Ginger.{can't hear}{same, I think it's something-san though, so it's probably something too niche to include}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.44,0:07:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With her help, Julie's made real strides in speaking Human.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.82,0:07:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She says she rented a room near the school.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.86,0:07:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}More like a wife who keeps her own place than a knight.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.41,0:07:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you need something?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.45,0:07:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I just wondered why you've pledged your fealty to Zanoba.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.83,0:08:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Because {*}Zanoba-sama{*Prince Zanoba}'s mother personally entrusted him to my care!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.25,0:08:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then and there, I swore to serve him to my dying breath!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.09,0:08:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? What a moving story.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.18,0:08:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And then?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.81,0:08:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all there is.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.60,0:08:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no subordinates. I traded my last one for the Roxy figurine.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.36,0:08:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a bargain that was!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.52,0:08:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can she really stay loyal after he treated her like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.49,0:08:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, I guess families come in all stripes.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.41,0:08:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It transmits mana from outside\N to counterbalance the mana in her body.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.29,0:08:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't achieve total suppression,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.75,0:08:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but it can extend her limit by several times.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.50,0:08:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, I guess it relieves the symptoms of Elinalise's curse.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.92,0:08:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But it has two problems.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.34,0:08:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. I suppose the first
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.05,0:08:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,is how ugly it looks.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.06,0:08:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.68,0:09:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But with Zanoba's and Silent's help, \NI think I can at least make it smaller.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.65,0:09:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the other problem?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.69,0:09:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This magical implement drains too much mana.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.45,0:09:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Even mine can only fuel it for an hour, let alone Lise's.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.12,0:09:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And since that limits us to a few tests per day, \NI'd like to try with your mana.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.50,0:09:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. You can count on me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.04,0:09:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.67,0:09:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cliff{*}-senpai{*}'s making slow but steady progress toward his goal, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.26,0:09:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good for him.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.47,0:09:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'd say I've been living well lately.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.10,0:09:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I work out,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.81,0:09:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}eat breakfast,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.48,0:09:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}then go see everyone at school and ask how their research is going.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.44,0:09:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I help Norn study,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.15,0:09:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}then go home for some family time.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.99,0:09:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Every day's pretty much the same, \Nbut I'm still moving forward step by step.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.29,0:10:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The old me never managed to live like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.54,0:10:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess this kind of life is what you call real happiness.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.97,0:10:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.14,0:10:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? It's still so early.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.94,0:10:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You see...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.44,0:10:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that the moment's here, I'm getting cold feet.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.57,0:10:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You have nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.23,0:10:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Sylphie{*}-nee{*}, show some courage!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.45,0:10:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Rudy...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.87,0:10:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't had a... you-know-what in two months.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.58,0:10:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And I felt a little off, so I started wondering.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.76,0:10:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I went with Aisha{*}-chan{*} to see a doctor,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.51,0:11:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and, well, I'm probably expecting.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.52,0:11:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Rudy, er, what do you think?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.98,0:11:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I-Is it okay if I feel it?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.57,0:11:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, sure. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.91,0:11:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Onii-sama{*Big Brother},
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.67,0:11:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,aren't you forgetting to tell your wife something?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.65,0:11:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sylphie.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.86,0:11:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why "thank you"?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.86,0:11:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I just... I don't know. \NI can't find the words.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.41,0:12:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You always did want kids, Rudy.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.81,0:12:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahem!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.68,0:12:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Onii-sama{*Big Brother},
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.18,0:12:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,your wife is in a delicate condition, \Nso for the time being...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.90,0:12:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We know.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.82,0:12:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Congratulations, Sylphie{*}-san{*}.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.32,0:12:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.99,0:12:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Ariel-sama{*Princess Ariel} wrote that you should take at least two years off, ma'am.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.74,0:12:51.88,Default,hon?,0,0,0,,Great-Aunt Elinalise volunteered to take over bodyguard duty in the meantime.{ooba?}{yeah, but that's outside the honorifics that count as quasi-loanwords so drop it}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.25,0:12:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Grandma will be okay, \Nwith her curse and everything.{no hon for stuff like this since it translates as well as "Mom", and we don't use honorifics for that.}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.05,0:12:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she'd figure something out, \Nso it shouldn't cause problems.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.09,0:13:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I informed the rest of your circle, as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.85,0:13:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They all said that they'll call to look in on you.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.22,0:13:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They did? Thank you, Aisha.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.85,0:13:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it, {*}Onii-sama{*Big Brother}.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.36,0:13:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for this meal.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.40,0:13:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I bet Dad will get a shock when we tell him we're having a baby.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.57,0:13:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to see the look on his face!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.62,0:13:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Guys like him spoil their grandkids, \Nso I know he'll be over the moon.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.12,0:13:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He went gaga when you two were born, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.54,0:13:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait, {*}Nii-san{*Big Brother}.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.55,0:13:46.35,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sylphie and I got married, \Nand we'll have our whole family.{is he saying they'll have the whole family here, all together?}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.85,0:13:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The paradise I dreamed of back in Buena is right around the corner.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.12,0:14:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,"Zenith's rescue difficult."
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.74,0:14:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,"Send help."
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.59,0:14:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.25,0:14:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.51,0:14:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,With what?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.59,0:14:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That letter. The one from Geese.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.01,0:14:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He said they're having trouble rescuing Zenith.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.81,0:14:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like trouble.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.72,0:14:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me, remember?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.85,0:14:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You said I'd regret it if I went to Begaritt!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.27,0:14:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you trick me?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.52,0:14:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Trick you? No!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.15,0:14:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go to Begaritt, you'll regret it.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.94,0:14:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.95,0:14:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.53,0:14:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. I see how it is now.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.87,0:14:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What you're trying to say is, \NI'll regret going to Begaritt,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.58,0:14:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll regret {\i1}not{\i0} going, too. Right?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.62,0:14:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, nothing like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.29,0:15:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, did you regret it until yesterday?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.00,0:15:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You made lots of friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.05,0:15:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You met all sorts of people and did some growing yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.76,0:15:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You cured your condition.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.64,0:15:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You made up with your sister.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.76,0:15:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.85,0:15:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,you even got married and fathered a kid.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.06,0:15:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, it hasn't been bad. Not bad at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.48,0:15:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But still! You told me!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.78,0:15:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You said I shouldn't go to Begaritt!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.53,0:15:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You tricked me!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.40,0:15:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, there. I didn't trick you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.57,0:15:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I'll give you the same advice.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.03,0:15:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Steer clear of the Begaritt continent. \NYou'll regret going there.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.83,0:15:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But come on! My family's in trouble!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.79,0:15:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,At least give me a reason!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.84,0:15:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't do that!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.30,0:15:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.55,0:15:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot what an asshole you are.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.38,0:15:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What a thing to say.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.34,0:15:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't my advice always come in handy?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.68,0:15:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean you're not tricking me!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.52,0:15:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. At least... At least tell me something!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.81,0:16:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna regret?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.98,0:16:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I even supposed to weigh my options like this?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.86,0:16:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Most people can't, you know?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.61,0:16:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a greedy guy.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.16,0:16:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares if I'm greedy?! I don't want any regrets!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.95,0:16:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think. It should be obvious.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.87,0:16:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You've spent a year and a half in school.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.96,0:16:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sisters took a year to reach you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.84,0:16:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You would have missed them for sure, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.67,0:16:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my sisters only came here after they got my letter.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.68,0:16:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'd never sent it, they would have stayed in Millis or the port town.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.89,0:16:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope. Paul would have sent them to Asura if you never wrote.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.02,0:16:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Lilia has family there.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.11,0:16:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? When you put it that way, \NI guess he would have.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.32,0:16:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same way now.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.95,0:16:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What will happen to Sylphie and the baby if you leave on a journey?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.78,0:16:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd need to travel to Begaritt and back.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.45,0:16:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you leave your wife alone that whole time?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.42,0:17:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'll end up with regrets whatever I do?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.42,0:17:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. You can't dodge regrets no matter how hard you try.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.38,0:17:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go to Begaritt, you'll miss out on a great opportunity.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.18,0:17:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I suggest you stay.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.93,0:17:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're that adamant, \NI guess I would regret it.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.15,0:17:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.15,0:17:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.61,0:17:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like some advice, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.65,0:17:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. I'll hear you out.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.61,0:17:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahem.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.11,0:17:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Rudeus, await the next mating season.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.66,0:17:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,When it comes, Linia and Pursena will make romantic overtures.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.75,0:17:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Have relations with one of them.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.58,0:17:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do that, and you will gain even greater happiness.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.88,0:17:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hang on!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.88,0:17:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}...ness.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.21,0:17:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to cheat?! {lit. "You're suddenly talking about cheating?!"}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.26,0:17:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I made up my mind to stay true to Sylphie!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.93,0:17:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And anyway, it's not like that between me and them!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.56,0:18:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Rudy?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.06,0:18:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You were tossing and turning.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.78,0:18:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.65,0:18:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Linia and Pursena aside, the Man-God has a point.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.20,0:18:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No matter how hard I think, \NI can never be absolutely certain.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.83,0:18:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can only say one thing for sure: \Nit takes at least a year to reach Begaritt.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.29,0:18:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that letter, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.92,0:18:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Rudy...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.59,0:18:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't worry too much about me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.47,0:18:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That letter has your sisters worried, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.60,0:18:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't go.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.61,0:18:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stay with you, Sylphie.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.95,0:18:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Send help." Something must have gone wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.91,0:19:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the letter came from Geese, not Paul.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.16,0:19:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He might have sent it on his own, \Nbefore he met up with Paul's group.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.17,0:19:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They might've rescued Zenith already. \NIf I go, I could miss them on the road.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.26,0:19:15.34,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,{\i1}Augh, but on the other hand...{he's waffling, right? like "ugh, but on the other hand..."}{yeah}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.81,0:19:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. You should stay here.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.77,0:19:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me {\i1}you're{\i0} going, Elinalise{*}-san{*}?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.52,0:19:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me do something for my granddaughter's family.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.78,0:19:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Cliff{*}-senpai{*}?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.36,0:19:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll break up with him. What else can I do?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.91,0:19:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll wait for you if you explain.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.53,0:19:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cliff has the makings of a future pope.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.20,0:19:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hold him back.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.29,0:19:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,His love for me was a youthful indiscretion.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.96,0:19:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving it at that will be the best thing for him.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.30,0:19:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.01,0:20:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no doubt you could sort things out in no time, Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.14,0:20:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wait here and continue my research, \Npraying for your speedy return.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.69,0:20:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I assumed you'd try to either stop me or join me.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.86,0:20:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd like my help, Master, I won't refuse.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.57,0:20:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But being unused to travel, I expect I'd slow you down.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.53,0:20:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.83,0:20:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I could hardly take Julie on such a long trek.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.62,0:20:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Zanoba, do you think I should go?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.88,0:20:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's for you to decide, Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.30,0:20:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But let me offer one piece of advice.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.47,0:20:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Children are born even if their father isn't there to watch it happen.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.22,0:20:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If you feel uneasy, I suggest you go.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.69,0:20:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise to defend your wife while you are gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.19,0:20:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, of course, I would rather never leave your side.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.82,0:21:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Zanoba.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.59,0:21:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Sylphie won't be alone. \NMy sisters are here with her.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.76,0:21:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}She'll do just fine without me.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.60,0:21:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}But I'm still the breadwinner of this household.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.98,0:21:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As a husband and a father, \NI have a duty to stand by my family.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:40.28,0:21:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't just leave them.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.42,0:21:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:02.93,0:22:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Norn?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:07.93,0:22:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:11.27,0:22:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought, if you won't go, I will.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:16.31,0:22:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Norn, you'd never make it.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:18.94,0:22:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}But, {*}Nii-san{*Big Brother}... Mom and Dad are in trouble.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:26.12,0:22:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Why...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:27.20,0:22:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Why aren't you going to help them?!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:31.29,0:22:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You're really strong! You can travel!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:35.96,0:22:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So why?!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:37.21,0:22:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Why?!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:40.63,0:22:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}She's right. I {\i0}can{\i1} do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:44.18,0:22:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm not like Norn. She can't go, \Nno matter how badly she wants to.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:50.27,0:22:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:53.35,0:22:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:01.57,0:23:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Norn.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:06.36,0:23:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:08.12,0:23:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you watch the house for me?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:13.83,0:23:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:15.08,0:23:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fight with Aisha, and help Sylphie.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:20.17,0:23:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:22.05,0:23:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. That's the spirit.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:24.55,0:23:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, {*}Nii-san{*Big Brother}.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:28.51,0:23:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:30.22,0:23:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to save our family.
